      "name": "scenario - honest student, identity theft, scopes, session end",
      "description": "From 4.0.0 the events of this scenario arrive from the Message Broker, which Postman cannot call, so they are not requests here any more. Publish them to the broker with the full envelope (docs/UNIVERSITY_RECORD_SERVICE.md, \u00a711) at the missing step numbers: 3 applicant.initialized of the honest FAF student (applicant {{honest_applicant_id}}, actual student_id FAF23117, name Ana Rusu) before step 5; 8 applicant.initialized of an outsider claiming FAF23117 (applicant {{thief_applicant_id}}) before step 9; 10 session.ended of {{session_id}} before step 11. Without them steps 5, 9 and 11 fail their tests. Step 4 sets the scopes with the session-service mock in place of session.started. Steps 4 and 9 are service calls on routes the Gateway's 4.0.0 does not serve (404), so they go to the instance directly ({{university_record_direct_url}}, no X-Service-Token, no X-Player-Id); steps 5, 6, 7 and 11 are the player route, through the Gateway with the JWT. Both must reach the same database (forward an instance of the team stack, docs/UNIVERSITY_RECORD_SERVICE.md, \u00a711).",
